List image updates in the sidebar

An "Updates available - N" section leads the sidebar whenever Diun has
reported updates: each row shows the service (or container) name, the image
tag, a Release notes link opening in a new tab (noopener noreferrer, http(s)
only) and a dismiss button; "Clear all" appears with two or more. Dismiss
controls are hidden in read-only mode, and a failed dismiss shows inline.
On phones, where the sidebar was hidden, the updates section alone is shown
below the services, with 44px touch targets.

Files: pihub/static/app.js, pihub/static/app.css
